OL,3,CTV-related anniversaries for 30 AUG
OL,4,CCHANNELS
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1958FSouthern Television - the ITV
OL,7,Ffranchisee for the south and south east
OL,8,Fof England - begins broadcasting.
OL,9,
OL,10,CG1984FThe technicians' strike at
OL,11,FThames Television continues. TV-am
OL,12,Ftransmissions are unaffected. The
OL,13,Fentire Thames TV schedule is blacked
OL,14,Fout. Viewers in the London area are
OL,15,Fpresented with a blue apology caption
OL,16,Fand silence.
