OL,3,CTV-related anniversaries for 30 AUG
OL,4,CCHANNELS
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1985FCentral Television launches new
OL,7,Fon-screen presentation. The 'Moon' logo
OL,8,Fis replaced by the more colourful
OL,9,F'Cake' logo. Trails featuring the new
OL,10,Flogo had been running since earlier in
OL,11,FAugust but today saw the formal launch
OL,12,Fof the new presentation package,
OL,13,Fcomplete with new idents.
